  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 21
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 21
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: 'Adelaida se retira.


    La iglesia desaprueba que perdones sus pecados.

    Te
    sientes bien.'
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3129.093
    y: 409.343
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-5589519985958107695
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Padre, \xBFse ha enterado de lo del hijo del molinero?\nCreo saber qu\xE9
    le ha sucedido. \nEstoy segura de que el colgante que menciona el peri\xF3dico
    tiene algo que ver. \n"
  childrenIDs:
  - 2
  - 3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 5.3125305
    y: 107.5625
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-5391277014709224202
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 18
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 18
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "\xBFPERDONE?\r\nPens\xE9 que su santidad respetar\xEDa el secreto de confesi\xF3n.\r\nSepa
    que, si me denuncia, pondr\xE1 en peligro mi negocio.\r\nNo puedo permitirlo.\r\nA
    los vecinos no les gustar\xE1 esto."
  childrenIDs:
  - 19
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2795.1904
    y: 208.24542
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-4496806242225592807
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 5
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "S\xE9 que es dif\xEDcil de creer, padre.\nLa anterior due\xF1a de ese colgante
    se hospedaba en mi posada hasta hace escasos d\xEDas.\r\nDec\xEDa que, desde
    que lo obtuvo, la muerte le susurraba al o\xEDdo."
  childrenIDs:
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 664.3125
    y: 230.5625
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &-2721775489112983544
