--- !u!114 &37017457394914586
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 4
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "S\xED...\nEscasos d\xEDas atr\xE1s, una mujer se hospedaba en mi posada.\nLlevaba
    un colgante, del que no se separar\xEDa ni para utilizar el excusado.\nEstoy
    segura de que es el mismo colgante del hijo del molinero.\nA pesar de que jam\xE1s
    se la quitaba,  aseguraba que hab\xEDa algo en aquella joya que la aterrorizaba."
  childrenIDs:
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 659.093
    y: -13.657013
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &149197817241713379
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 7
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "\xBFPor qu\xE9 no denunci\xF3 a la mujer?"
  childrenIDs:
  - 9
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1414.093
    y: 5.342987
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &1148750479789260838
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 9
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Porque era mi cliente.\r\nLa pol\xEDtica de mi posada es que todos los clientes
    gocen de m\xE1xima privacidad.\r\nTodos tenemos nuestros secretos.\r\nNo puedo
    permitirme manchar mi negocio revelando los de mis clientes.\r\nUsted me entender\xE1,
    lleva este confesionario.\r\nSimplemente pens\xE9 que, si se deshac\xEDa del
    colgante, la posada no correr\xEDa peligro."
  childrenIDs:
  - 11
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1767.093
    y: 4.342987
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &1989529178047758375
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 15
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 15
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "Encubrimiento: Puedes irte. Tus decisiones no se volver\xE1n en tu contra."
  childrenIDs:
  - 22
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2435.093
    y: 593.343
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 1
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 1
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &2286711115998723691
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Yo misma le dije que se desiciera del amuleto.\r\nNo pod\xEDa permitir que
    un objeto m\xE1gico pusiera en peligro mi negocio.\r\nMas nunca pens\xE9 que
    se lo entregar\xEDa a un ni\xF1o...\r\nLa mujer abandon\xF3 el pueblo poco despu\xE9s.\r\nTal
    vez, carcomida por la culpa de lo que hab\xEDa hecho."
  childrenIDs:
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1043.093
    y: 121.34299
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &2884893493116234219
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 19
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 19
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: 'Adelaida se retira


    La iglesia aprueba que sus pecados sean castigados.

    Al
    pueblo le disgustan tus acusaciones.'
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3130.093
    y: 219.34299
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &3118150872621594521
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 13
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 13
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: 'Denuncia: Ocultas en tu posada a personas peligrosas para el pueblo. No
    puedo pasarlo por alto.'
  childrenIDs:
  - 18
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2434.093
    y: 204.34299
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 1
  RepPuebloCost: -1
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &3627911864998200633
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "La culpa pesa en mi coraz\xF3n.\r\nNo puedo evitar pensar que, por mi af\xE1n
    de proteger el negocio evit\xE9 el destino que le aguardaba.\r\nY ahora un ni\xF1o
    inocente ha muerto en su lugar.\r\nPadre, \xBFme equivoqu\xE9 al proteger a esa
    mujer?"
  childrenIDs:
  - 12
  - 13
  - 14
  - 15
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2117.093
    y: 115.34299
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
--- !u!114 &3710427057488511410
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 23
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 23
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: 'Adelaida se retira.]



    Los aldeanos aprueban que mantengas sus confesiones
    en secreto.

    Te sientes bien.'
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3128.093
    y: 603.343
    width: 300
